{"ref":"BDB, קָרְחִי","hw":"קָרְחִי","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">קָרְחִי</span></big>  <strong>adj.gent.</strong> of <span dir=\"rtl\">קֹרַח</span> <strong>2</strong>; always c. art.; <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 9:31\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.9.31\">1 Ch 9:31</a>; as subst. coll. <a data-ref=\"Exodus 6:24\" href=\"/Exodus.6.24\">Ex 6:24</a> <a data-ref=\"Numbers 26:58\" href=\"/Numbers.26.58\">Nu 26:58</a>; pl. <span dir=\"rtl\">הַקָּרְחִים</span> <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 9:19\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.9.19\">1 Ch 9:19</a>; <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 12:7\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.12.7\">12:7</a> (van d. H. v <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 12:6\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.12.6\">6</a>), <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 26:1\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.26.1\">26:1</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">בְּנֵי הַקָּרְחִי</span> v <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 26:19\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.26.19\">19</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">בְּנֵי הַקָּרְחִים</span> <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 20:19\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.20.19\">2 Ch 20:19</a>.","next":"BDB, קרח","prev":"BDB, קֹ֫רַח"}